            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>Air sealing will have the most significant impact on energy savings. The current air leakage rate id very high in this house mostly due to the door and window that do not seal properly. </airSeal>
                <mainWalls>Increasing the insulation by R-20 or more will also have a significant impact on energy savings. This will aslo be eligible for a Good Energy rebate. </mainWalls>
                <foundation>Adding insulation to the floor will have a small impact on savings but adding R-20 or more will be eligible for a Good Energy Rebate. </foundation>
                <windows>Upgarding the windows to Energy Star windows for this region will save money and be eligible for a Good Energy rebate.</windows>
                <HeatingSystem>Cold climate heat pumps will save energy over traditional base board heating. </HeatingSystem>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
